('27','CNR2025100005','Unable to access syudent Portal anf submjt assignments - urgent academic issues','I am experiencing a critical technical problem that is preventing me from accessing the student portal and submitting my assignments. This issue started yesterday evening and has persisted throughout today. I am unable to log into my account using my student credentials, and when I try to reset my password, the system shows an error message saying \'Invalid user credentials\' even though I know my login information is correct. This is particularly urgent because I have three assignments due this week for my Computer Programming course (CS101) with Professor Johnson, and I cannot submit them through the online portal. I have already contacted my professor about this issue, but he mentioned that technical problems need to be resolved through the IT department. I have tried accessing the portal from different devices (my laptop, phone, and the library computers) and different internet connections, but the problem persists. I also cleared my browser cache and cookies, but that didn\'t resolve the issue. This is affecting my academic performance and I\'m concerned about meeting my assignment deadlines. I would appreciate immediate assistance from the IT department to resolve this login issue so I can continue with my coursework without further delays. Please let me know if you need any additional information about my account or the specific error messages I\'m encountering.','technical','high','student_confirmed','0','41','6',NULL,'130','[]',NULL,NULL,'2025-10-02 16:52:46','2025-10-02 17:04:13','Confirmed via mobile app',NULL,NULL,'2025-10-02 17:04:13','5','0',NULL,NULL,'0','2025-10-02 16:25:51','2025-10-02 17:04:13',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
